ameName":"Mini Dungeons","GameDescription":"MiniDungeons is a simple turn-based roguelike puzzle game, implemented as a benchmark problem for modeling decision making styles of human players","LevelName":"mdungeons-v0","LevelDescription":"","Tiles":"\r\nTile Character|Tile Name|Tile Description|Minimum Number Of Tile|Maximum Number Of Tiles\r\n---|---|---|---|---\r\n0|Wall|Solid impassable wall||\r\n1|Floor|Walkable floor||\r\n2|Player|The player\u0027s starting position|1|1\r\n3|Exit|The player\u0027s exit for this particular level. This is the goal of the level|1|1\r\n4|Potion|Heals the player for 2 HP|8|\r\n5|Treasure|These must be collected by the player to unlock the exit|0|20\r\n6|Goblin|Enemy which damages for 1 HP|4|8\r\n7|Ogre|Enemy which damages for 2 HP|4|8\r\n","Width":"8","Height":"12","GameType":"Top Down","GameGenre":"Roguelike Puzzle","DifficultyLevel":"Medium","HazardLevel":"Easy","CustomConstraints":"The solution length **must** be between 16 and 48 \nThe wall and floor tiles **must** compose at least 50% of the map\nThe amount of enemies killed on the shortest solution for the level **must** be more than 8. Think thoroughly through it to make sure this is **ALWAYS** true.\nThe level **must** be fully connected","TemplateFilePath":"PromptV1.hbs"},"mdungeons-v0_1":{"GameName":"Mini Dungeons","GameDescription":"MiniDungeons is a simple turn-based roguelike puzzle game, implemented as a benchmark problem for modeling decision making styles of human players","LevelName":"mdungeons-v0","LevelDescription":"","Tiles":"\r\nTile Character|Tile Name|Tile Description|Minimum Number Of Tile|Maximum Number Of Tiles\r\n---|---|---|---|---\r\n0|Wall|Solid impassable wall||\r\n1|Floor|Walkable floor||\r\n2|Player|The player\u0027s starting position|1|1\r\n3|Exit|The player\u0027s exit for this particular level. This is the goal of the level|1|1\r\n4|Potion|Heals the player for 2 HP|8|\r\n5|Treasure|These must be collected by the player to unlock the exit|0|20\r\n6|Goblin|Enemy which damages for 1 HP|4|8\r\n7|Ogre|Enemy which damages for 2 HP|4|8\r\n","Width":"8","Height":"12","GameType":"Top Down","GameGenre":"Roguelike Puzzle","DifficultyLevel":"Medium","HazardLevel":"Easy","CustomConstraints":"The solution length **must** be between 16 and 48 \nThe wall and floor tiles **must** compose at least 50% of the map\nThe amount of enemies killed on the shortest solution for the level **must** be more than 8. Think thoroughly through it to make sure this is **ALWAYS** true.\nThe level **must** be fully connected","TemplateFilePath":"PromptV1.hbs"},"mdungeons-v0_2":{"GameName":"Mini Dungeons","GameDescription":"MiniDungeons is a simple turn-based roguelike puzzle game, implemented as a benchmark problem for modeling decision making styles of human players","LevelName":"mdungeons-v0","LevelDescription":"","Tiles":"\r\nTile Character|Tile Name|Tile Description|Minimum Number Of Tile|Maximum Number Of Tiles\r\n---|---|---|---|---\r\n0|Wall|Solid impassable wall||\r\n1|Floor|Walkable floor||\r\n2|Player|The player\u0027s starting position|1|1\r\n3|Exit|The player\u0027s exit for this particular level. This is the goal of the level|1|1\r\n4|Potion|Heals the player for 2 HP|8|\r\n5|Treasure|These must be collected by the player to unlock the exit|0|20\r\n6|Goblin|Enemy which damages for 1 HP|4|8\r\n7|Ogre|Enemy which damages for 2 HP|4|8\r\n","Width":"8","Height":"12","GameType":"Top Down","GameGenre":"Roguelike Puzzle","DifficultyLevel":"Medium","HazardLevel":"Easy","CustomConstraints":"The solution length **must** be between 16 and 48 \nThe wall and floor tiles **must** compose at least 50% of the map\nThe amount of enemies killed on the shortest solution for the level **must** be more than 8. Think thoroughly through it to make sure this is **ALWAYS** true.\nThe level **must** be fully connected","TemplateFilePath":"PromptV1.hbs"},"mdungeons-v0_3":{"GameName":"Mini Dungeons","GameDescription":"MiniDungeons is a simple turn-based rogue